   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "At the front door, young Daisuke sees his father off to work and asks him to come home early. Muranishi claims he has overtime tonight, until sharp-eyed Mayumi spots arcade coins spilling out of his pocket. Listen to this morning send-off.",
